          Joining firefly puts you directly in touch with entertainment
          and people you'd like, based on your tastes and preferences.
          
          Membership is absolutely free and the information you provide
          below [i.e. in the membership form] will only be used to offer 
          you information and experiences based on you. This information 
          will never be disclosed to anyone without your explicit prior 
          consent.
          
          We're committed to building a thriving community based on
          trust, privacy and freedom of expression; please read more
          about the firefly Community Policy.
          
