   firefly Terms of Service
   
   By joining and using firefly, you agree to use firefly according to
   these Terms of Service as outlined below.
   
   FEEL FREE TO EXPRESS YOURSELF
   
   Comments and contributions from members should be consistent with
   firefly community values and comply with applicable laws. Since we
   cannot prevent members from placing inappropriate or illegal content
   on firefly, we can only remove such content once we have been made
   aware of its existence. We do reserve the right to remove material
   brought to our attention that violates applicable laws. We can also
   block a member's access to the site if we receive documented
   complaints about the member's contributions and communications on
   firefly. The information, advice, facts, opinions or other content
   appearing on firefly that are posted by members or third parties are
   those of the respective authors and do not reflect our views. We do
   not assume responsibility or liability for these materials.
   
   COPYRIGHTED INFORMATION
   
   By contributing to firefly, you represent that you have all of the
   necessary rights to the use of the materials, communications, or other
   information that you have provided to or displayed on firefly. Because
   we are committed to promoting user content and sharing the works of
   the firefly community outside firefly online, you automatically grant
   us or acknowledge that the owner of these items grants us the
   royalty-free, irrevocable right to copy and re-use the items in any
   form, media, or technology now known or hereafter developed, in any
   manner that we see fit.
   
